WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.460
Missed appointments. Paper charts. Forgotten check-ups. Sound familiar?

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.120
Meet Astra Smile. One simple app to run your dental clinic.

3
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.347
Patients find you on your own clinic website, and book a visit online.

4
00:00:13.027 --> 00:00:17.295
New patients fill in their details, medical history, and ABHA number online.

5
00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:23.156
Appointments by chair and dentist, walk-ins and emergencies included, with WhatsApp reminders.

6
00:00:23.836 --> 00:00:29.303
On a simple tooth chart, the dentist marks fillings, root canals, implants, and extractions.

7
00:00:29.983 --> 00:00:34.467
Digital X-rays, full-mouth scans, and 3D scans are saved with each patient.

8
00:00:35.147 --> 00:00:40.054
Patients see the plan and cost, sign consent on screen, and get prescriptions on WhatsApp.

9
00:00:40.734 --> 00:00:45.065
Crowns, bridges, and dentures sent to the lab are tracked, until they come back.

10
00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:49.592
Clear aligners and braces are tracked, tray by tray, month by month.

11
00:00:50.272 --> 00:00:55.673
Pay by cash, card, UPI, or easy instalments, with GST bills on WhatsApp.

12
00:00:56.353 --> 00:01:00.550
Patients see their records and bills in their own app, and happy ones leave a Google review.

13
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:05.503
Six months later, the app reminds patients to come back for a check-up and cleaning.

14
00:01:06.183 --> 00:01:11.501
Stock, sterilisation, waste, and licences are tracked, so you're always inspection-ready.

15
00:01:12.181 --> 00:01:15.716
See every chair and branch live, and close the day's cash in one click.

16
00:01:16.396 --> 00:01:20.251
New staff learn safely in a practice clinic, and we set everything up with you.

17
00:01:20.931 --> 00:01:26.621
It works in your language too: Tamil, Hindi, Malayalam, Telugu, Kannada, and more.

18
00:01:27.301 --> 00:01:31.389
Astra Smile. Your dental clinic, made simple. Book a free demo today.
